<title>MALTA: Malta t-bills yield up slightly.</title>
<headline>Malta t-bills yield up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury will on Friday issue 19.6 million Maltese Lira ($53 million) in 91-day Treasury Bills maturing March 21, 1997.</p>
<p>The average yield rate is 5.0052 percent per annum, slightly higher than the previous 91-day issue of December 6, which had a yield rate of 5.0048 percent.</p>
</text>
